{title: For All the Saints}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{+pdf.diagrams.show: right}

{start_of_verse: 1}
For [C]all the [Am]saints[**], who [F]from their [G]labors [C]rest[**]
Who [D]Thee[**] by [G]faith [**]be[C]fore the [D]world con[G]fes[**]sed
Thy [C]Name, [Am]O [G]Je[**]-sus, [F]be for[Dm]ever [G]blessed
[Em]A[F]-lle-[C]lu-[Am]ia[F], A[Dm]-lle-[G]lu-[C]ia[**]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
Thou [C]wast their [Am]rock[**], their [F]fortress [G]and their [C]might[**]
Thou, [D]Lord[**], their [G]cap[**]tain [C]in the [D]well fought [G]fight[**]
[C]Thou, [Am]in the [G]da[**]rkness [F]drear, their [Dm]one true [G]Light
[Em]A[F]-lle-[C]lu-[Am]ia[F], A[Dm]-lle-[G]lu-[C]ia[**]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
O [C]may Thy [Am]sol[**]-diers, [F]faithful, [G]true and [C]bold[**]
[D]Fight [**]as the [G]saints [**]who [C]nobly [D]fought of [G]old[**]
And [C]win [Am]with [G]them[**] the [F]victor's [Dm]crown of [G]gold
[Em]A[F]-lle-[C]lu-[Am]ia[F], A[Dm]-lle-[G]lu-[C]ia[**]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
O [C]blest com[Am]mu[**]-nion [F]fellow[G]ship di[C]vine[**]
[D]We [**]feebly [G]stru[**]ggle, [C]they in [D]glory [G]shine[**]
Yet [C]all [Am]are [G]one[**] in [F]thee for [Dm]all are [G]thine
[Em]A[F]-lle-[C]lu-[Am]ia[F], A[Dm]-lle-[G]lu-[C]ia[**]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 5}
And [C]when the [Am]strife[**] is [F]fierce, the [G]warfare [C]long[**]
[D]Steals [**]on the [G]ear [**]the [C]distant [D]triumph [G]song[**]
And [C]hearts [Am]are [G]brave[**] a[F]gain and [Dm]arms are [G]strong
[Em]A[F]-lle-[C]lu-[Am]ia[F], A[Dm]-lle-[G]lu-[C]ia[**]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 6}
From [C]earth's wide [Am]bounds[**], from [F]ocean's [G]farthest [C]coast[**]
Through [D]gates[**] of [G]pearl [**]streams [C]in the [D]countless [G]host[**]
[C]Sin[Am]ging to [G]Fa[**]-ther, [F]Son, and [Dm]Holy [G]Ghost
[Em]A[F]-lle-[C]lu-[Am]ia[F], A[Dm]-lle-[G]lu-[C]ia[**]
{end_of_verse}
